  <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
  <div slot="col-1-images">
    <img src="/poems/march-poem-eilas-90th-birthday-21-02-2015/image-6.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/march-poem-eilas-90th-birthday-21-02-2015/image-8.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 2 Text -->
  <div slot="col-2-text">
    <p>
      I’ve reached my 90th birthday,
      I never thought I’d live so long;
      Seldom took drugs and no vitamin pills,
      Yet I can’t have gone too far wrong.
    </p>

    <p>
      Oh, I may be as deaf as a door nail
      And my eyesight is fast growing dim;
      Though I can’t dance all the jigs and the reels,
      The ones I can do keeps me in trim.
    </p>

    <p>
      I’ve never been outside Scotland’s soil,
      As far as holidays go, I’ve had none;
      But I’ve got all I need here in Westmuir,
      With the scenic hills, my job and my home.
    </p>

    <p>
      I’m back in the house where I was born,
      Got married in this hall so dear to me;
      And our honeymoon was spent ‘up the brae’,
      In a wee house behind my ain folk, you see.
    </p>

    <p>
      I fell heir to my Dad’s market garden,
      And enjoy growing fruit and veg in my plot;
      Along with my computer, music and verse,
      I’m really happy and content with my lot.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
  <div slot="col-3-images">
    <img src="/poems/march-poem-eilas-90th-birthday-21-02-2015/image-2.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/march-poem-eilas-90th-birthday-21-02-2015/image-3.png" alt="" />
    <img src="/poems/march-poem-eilas-90th-birthday-21-02-2015/image-4.png" alt="" />
  </div>

  <!-- Column 4 Text -->
  <div slot="col-4-text">
    <p>
      Today I’ll be making lots of sweet memories,
      While surrounded by my dearest friends,
      Who stand by me through thick and thin,
      Whenever one of life’s storms descend.
    </p>

    <p>
      Always willing to help so I don’t feel alone
      I’m sure to find someone there if I call;
      Transport laid on, and there at my gate,
      Keeping an eye out for me should I fall.
    </p>

    <p>
      So, let’s make this a real joyful fun day,
      The very best ever seen in this hall;
      As I include in my 90th B	B	B	Birthday spree,
      A great big THANK YOU now to you all!
    </p>

    <p>
      Eila’s 90	Eila’s 90	Eila’s 90	Eila’s 90th	th	th	th Birth	Birth	Birth	Birthda	da	da	day Poem	y Poem	y Poem	y Poem
      Eila recited her poem in
      the Westmuir hall at her
      90th Birthday party.
    </p>
  </div>

